      "question": "Who is Gerard Butler?",
      "answer": "Gerard James Butler is a Scottish actor and film producer born on 13 November 1969 in Paisley, Renfrewshire, Scotland. He studied law at the University of Glasgow before training at the Royal Conservatoire of Scotland and turning to acting in the mid-1990s."
