    {
      "question": "What is Gerard Butler best known for?",
      "answer": "He is best known for playing King Leonidas in 300 (2006), Secret Service agent Mike Banning in the Has Fallen series (Olympus, London and Angel Has Fallen), Stoick the Vast in the How to Train Your Dragon films, and the Phantom in The Phantom of the Opera (2004)."
    },
